{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-60563","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90321","text":"FleetPrompt Documentation"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60565","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90322","marks":["bold"],"text":"The open marketplace where production-ready AI agents are published, discovered, and deployed in one click."}]}],"id":"blk-60564","kind":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60567","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90323","marks":["bold"],"text":"Part of the [&] Protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-90324","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-90325","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/ECOSYSTEM.md"}],"text":"Ecosystem overview"},{"id":"spn-90326","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-90327","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/PULSE/docs/THREE_PROTOCOL_STACK.md"}],"text":"Three-protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-90328","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-90329","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/STACK_COMPLETION.md"}],"text":"Stack status"}]}],"id":"blk-60566","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-60568","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90330","text":"Welcome to the documentation hub for "},{"id":"spn-90331","marks":["bold"],"text":"FleetPrompt"},{"id":"spn-90332","text":" — the open agent marketplace for the [&] Protocol ecosystem. FleetPrompt is the registry where production-ready AI agents are published, discovered, and deployed. Every listed agent carries a versioned manifest, a computed trust score, declared permissions, and a linked SpecPrompt spec — making FleetPrompt the first marketplace where you know exactly what an agent does before you install it."}]},{"id":"blk-60569","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90333","text":"Why FleetPrompt?"}]},{"id":"blk-60570","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90334","text":"57% of organizations now have AI agents in production (LangChain 2026). Yet there are "},{"id":"spn-90335","marks":["bold"],"text":"zero open agent marketplaces"},{"id":"spn-90336","text":". Teams build agents in isolation, rediscover the same patterns, and have no way to share, reuse, or monetize production-quality work. Closed platforms (Salesforce AgentForce, OpenAI GPT Store) lock agents into proprietary runtimes. Open frameworks (LangGraph, CrewAI) have no distribution story at all."}]},{"id":"blk-60571","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90337","text":"FleetPrompt is the "},{"id":"spn-90338","marks":["bold"],"text":"distribution layer"},{"id":"spn-90339","text":" of the [&] Protocol ecosystem:"}]},{"id":"blk-60572","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (Standards)    → defines agent behavior as versioned specs\n    ↓\nAgentelic (Engineering)   → builds, tests, deploys agents against specs\n    ↓\nOpenSentience (Runtime)   → governs, executes, observes agents locally\n    ↓\nGraphonomous (Memory)     → continual learning knowledge graphs\n    ↓\nFleetPrompt (Distribution) ← THIS  ·  Delegatic (Orchestration)"},{"id":"blk-60573","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90340","text":"Documentation Map"}]},{"id":"blk-60574","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90341","marks":["bold"],"text":"Homepages"}]},{"id":"blk-60575","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60577","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90342","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://ampersandboxdesign.com"}],"text":"[&] Ampersand Box"}]}],"id":"blk-60576","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60579","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90343","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://graphonomous.com"}],"text":"Graphonomous"}]}],"id":"blk-60578","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60581","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90344","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://bendscript.com"}],"text":"BendScript"}]}],"id":"blk-60580","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60583","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90345","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://webhost.systems"}],"text":"WebHost.Systems"}]}],"id":"blk-60582","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60585","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90346","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://agentelic.com"}],"text":"Agentelic"}]}],"id":"blk-60584","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60587","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90347","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://agentromatic.com"}],"text":"AgenTroMatic"}]}],"id":"blk-60586","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60589","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90348","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://delegatic.com"}],"text":"Delegatic"}]}],"id":"blk-60588","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60591","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90349","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://deliberatic.com"}],"text":"Deliberatic"}]}],"id":"blk-60590","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60593","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90350","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://fleetprompt.com"}],"text":"FleetPrompt"}]}],"id":"blk-60592","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60595","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90351","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://geofleetic.com"}],"text":"GeoFleetic"}]}],"id":"blk-60594","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60597","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90352","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://opensentience.org"}],"text":"OpenSentience"}]}],"id":"blk-60596","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60599","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90353","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://specprompt.com"}],"text":"SpecPrompt"}]}],"id":"blk-60598","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60601","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90354","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://ticktickclock.com"}],"text":"TickTickClock"}]}],"id":